OL,3,GNEWSALeaderless council agrees to
OL,4,Atemporary power share
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council which has been without a
OL,7,Fleader since May this year has agreed
OL,8,Fto a temporary power-sharing
OL,9,Farrangement, following months of
OL,10,Fpolitical deadlock.
OL,12,FOldham Council has been unable to form
OL,13,Fan administration after no political
OL,14,Fgroup secured enough support in local
OL,15,Felections to assume control of the
OL,16,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
